00:03:10.997 --> 00:03:13.080
FRANCESC CAMPOY: The second
cool thing of the week

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.850
is actually with certifications.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:18.020
And it's about ISO
certifications.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:22.500
So recently, we got two
more, two new certifications

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.950
for the Google Cloud Platform.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.430
And I'm sure you
have the numbers.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.430
I know that one is for
privacy and the other one

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.520
is for security.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.872
But I never remember the names.

00:03:30.872 --> 00:03:31.676
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:03:31.676 --> 00:03:36.640
We did ISO 27017 for cloud
security and ISO 27018

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:37.380
for privacy.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.680
Those are the two new ones.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:42.640
And we also renewed our
ISO 27001 certificate

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.280
for the fourth year in a row.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.196
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:03:45.196 --> 00:03:48.350
And this actually covers
basically all the things

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:49.960
in Google Cloud Platform.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.820
So data flow, big table,
content arranging, data prog,

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.910
container registry,
Compute Engine, App Engine,

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.040
and et cetera, et cetera.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.170
Basically, all the things
that you can imagine,

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.430
they're covered by
this ISO certificate.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.720
So very often it's a requirement
depending on the industry

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.680
you're a part of.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.970
It's always good to know
that we've got you covered.

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:11.120
MARK MANDEL: Yep.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.060
And I think just the
general takeaway,

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.342
we really care about security.

00:04:14.342 --> 00:04:15.550
We really care about privacy.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.923
This is just another thing
that we do in that area.

00:04:17.923 --> 00:04:19.339
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Yeah, absolutely.

00:04:19.339 --> 00:04:22.300
And we'll put the link
on the show notes.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.635
But there's a
cloud.google.com/security

00:04:24.635 --> 00:04:27.790
that's something that you
want to learn more about.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.220
MARK MANDEL: Absolutely.

