00:26:41.380 --> 00:26:45.090
Thank you, Brian, also for
helping us with this interview.

00:26:45.090 --> 00:26:46.180
MARK MANDEL: Absolutely.

00:26:46.180 --> 00:26:48.305
He jumped in because I had
