00:27:07.650 --> 00:27:08.080
MARK MANDEL: Probably.

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:08.636
Yeah.

00:27:08.636 --> 00:27:10.510
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah,
which is totally fine.

